Package: wfantund
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, libreadline8, libcoap2
Description: Userspace Wireless Field Area Network (WFAN) Network Daemon
 wfantund is a user-space network interface driver/daemon that provides a
 native IPv6 network interface to TI Wi-SUN FAN Border Router operating in
 Network Processor (NWP) mode.
